 "meta": {"name": "FLOOR PLAN 6", "sheet": "FLOOR", "world": {"w": 109.73, "h": 106.36}, "note": "Scale 5.167 pt/m (20.67 px/m on layout.png) from the printed 24 x 14 m stage area (124 x 72 pt) and 6 x 10 m stage, checked on the printed 3 m booths (15.5 pt) and the 12 x 8 m workshop. Coordinates come from the PDF vector data. Origin: hall top-left at (1,1). 1 fit, 16 fnb, 272 goods (S1 to S15 in the FNB zone are fnb; U-ids are booths with no printed ID: U1 JSN, U2 ANIMALIUM, U3 KEBUN RAYA BOGOR, U4 COFFEE SHOP, U5 FITTING ROOM, U6 GRID NETWORK); 20 tables, 40 chairs (40 at tables, 0 in audience rows): the 20 picnic sets of the FNB zone, a table with a bench on each side, each bench a chair of that table; 1 wall (the south wall; the hall has no other drawn partition). Sponsor booths with a printed ID are booths. B38 and B39 are printed twice (beauty zone and mom and baby zone). Two rectangles hold a hidden second label; the one matching the zone prefix is used (B75 not A59, M21 not D78). The south wall opens in two 12 m gaps, each split by a 1 m column into two doors of about 5.5 m: the left two carry the OUT arrows (exit), the right two the IN arrows (entrance). The lobby is the two passages through the room band plus the foyer, cut at the image edge. Gates sit at the tail of the first IN arrow and exitPt at the head of the first OUT arrow. The peach FACILITIES boxes are fixtures (15); the 4 round black dots are columns of d 1 m; the 22 black squares on the top and bottom wall lines are block pilasters. Left out: doors on the north wall, the red-brown and grey zone fills around the stage, the thick line along the stage area, the toilet and cafe rooms south of the wall, the foyer items (sustainability corner, donation box, ambience installation, peach bars), and the objects outside the east wall (giant maps)."},
